<p id="mwAw">In molecular biology <b id="mwBA">mir-661 microRNA</b> is a short <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Non-coding_RNA" title="Non-coding RNA" id="mwBQ">RNA</a> molecule. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./MicroRNA" title="MicroRNA" id="mwBg">MicroRNAs</a> function to regulate the expression levels of other genes by several mechanisms.</p>

